WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.288
What does a fundraiser look like

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.570
from the welcome desk?

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.548
At the Victoria Venezuela Foundation's

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.610
charity golf tournament,

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.010
we helped with registration,

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.910
guest technology, and sound.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:12.570
For your fundraiser,

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.430
the right help might look different.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.130
Maybe it's a check-in team.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.950
Maybe it's someone to call the show.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.448
With Cause on Cue, we sit down

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.948
with your nonprofit and agree

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.270
on the work, the cost,

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.470
and who's taking it on.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.210
Applications are open for the next
pilot.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.008
Tell us where your team

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.040
could use a hand.
